  "meaning": "Risk query uses only action-time visible rosters, the toroidal rules and all five primitive actions of each potentially intercepting enemy unit. There is no friction from unseen opponent routes, so this envelope checks whether an attainable cell can be threatened, not its probability; pairwise danger can overstate actual multiway collision harm. Give a self-collision-free action only if nobody on our side can enter that cell this turn and no newborn can appear there. The separate official counterfactual fixes both teams’ remaining simultaneous orders, including enemy orders; counterfactual success neither identifies economic superiority nor predicts a full game.",
